  "description": "Theme overrides applied on top of an inherited theme. Fields are replaced whole: naming `background` replaces the entire descriptor, since blending half a fill into a nine-slice has no meaning. Single-property tweaks belong on the widget (`panel.setFill({ color })`), not in a theme patch.",
